SkinForger 使用条款
SkinForger Terms of Use

源码公开 / Source-Available
版本 1.0 ・ 2026-11-20

Copyright (c) 2026 雷茂教主Ray5Green (Ray5Green)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
这不是一份标准许可证，也不是什么新发明的许可证类型。
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

它只是**这个项目自己写的使用条款**，用大白话写成，没有别的项目在用它，
也不打算让别的项目用。请不要把它当成一个可以套用的通用许可证。

要归类的话，它属于业界说的「**源码公开（source-available）**」：
源码公开、可自由取用，但保留了一条限制，所以按开源促进会（OSI）的定义
**不算「开源许可证」**。说「源码公开」是准确的，说「开源」不准确。

下面第一层（代码随便拿）的宽松程度基本等同 MIT 许可证；
第二层那一条限制，才是它不能叫「开源」的原因。

这份条款是作者自己写的，用大白话表达意图。
This text was written by the author in plain language to state intent.

================================================================================
中文（以中文本为准）
================================================================================

这份许可证分两层：**代码可以随便拿**，**但 SkinForger 这个成品不能搬到盗版平台上**。

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
第一层　代码、做法和文档 —— 随便用，没有任何条件
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

本项目的源代码、其中的算法与做法、以及 `docs/` 下的全部开发文档，
你都可以自由地阅读、复制、修改、学习、讲解、搬进自己的项目，
**用于任何目的，包括商业用途**。

不需要署名，不需要开源你自己的项目，不需要告诉我，也不需要付钱。

特别地，扩框机制（见 `docs/expansion/扩框机制说明.txt`）本来就是写出来给人看的。拿去用。

> 这一层没有任何附加条件。如果你只是想用这里的技术，看到这里就够了。

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
第二层　SkinForger 这个成品 —— 一个条件
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

当你分发的东西**就是 SkinForger**，或者是**一眼能认出是 SkinForger 的修改版**
（换了名字也算）时，适用下面这一条：

**唯一的条件：不得把它用于、适配到、或分发给非 Steam 正版的《Muse Dash（喵斯快跑）》。**

包括但不限于：破解版、盗版、未经授权的移植版、未经授权的移动端或主机端版本，
以及任何未经发行商授权的分发渠道。

「Steam 正版」指通过 Valve 的 Steam 商店取得、并通过 Steam 运行的《Muse Dash》副本。

如果你想为别的平台做，**可以来问我**。同意就是同意，不同意就是不同意。
联系方式见项目主页。

除此之外没有别的限制：你可以自由地使用、复制、修改、合并、发布、分发、再授权和出售，
**包括商业用途**。

唯一的手续：分发 SkinForger 或其修改版时，请把这份许可证一起带上，
好让下一个人也知道上面这一条。（只是搬代码片段的话，连这个都不需要——见第一层。）

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
第三层　不保证，不负责
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

**本软件按「现状」提供，不附带任何形式的保证**，无论明示或默示，
包括但不限于适销性、特定用途适用性和不侵权的保证。

**作者不对任何后果负责。** 你用了这份代码、或用了 SkinForger，
无论出现什么问题——游戏损坏、存档丢失、账号受影响、数据损毁、经济损失，
或任何其他直接或间接的损害——**都由你自己承担**。

你修改之后出的问题，更是你自己的问题，与作者无关。

你使用本软件，即表示你接受这一点。

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
第四层　不属于这份许可证的东西
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

**玩家做的皮肤**（PNG、JSON、音频等）属于各自的作者，不属于本项目，
也不受这份许可证约束。分发别人做的皮肤前，请先取得那位作者的同意。

**游戏本身的素材**不属于本项目，也不随本项目分发。

**上游项目**：SkinForger 最初是 MuseDashSkinChanger（原作者 BustR75 及贡献者，GPL-3.0）
的修改版。那部分代码已于 2026-11-17 起全部重写移除，现在的 SkinForger 不含上游代码
（证据见 `NOTICE.md`）。即便如此，这个项目能起步仍然多亏了他们公开的代码，谢谢。

================================================================================
English (the Chinese text governs if the two differ)
================================================================================

These terms have two layers: **take the code freely**, but **do not put SkinForger
itself on pirated platforms**.

--- Layer 1: the code, the techniques and the documentation — no conditions ---

You may read, copy, modify, learn from, teach, and reuse this project's source
code, the algorithms and techniques in it, and all of the development notes under
`docs/`, for ANY purpose, INCLUDING COMMERCIAL ONES.

No attribution required. No obligation to open your own project. No need to ask,
and nothing to pay. The canvas-expansion mechanism in particular was written down
to be read — please take it.

--- Layer 2: SkinForger as a product — one condition ---

When what you distribute IS SkinForger, or is recognisably a modified SkinForger
(renaming it does not change that), then:

  THE ONE CONDITION: it may not be used for, adapted to, or distributed for any
  copy of Muse Dash that is not a legitimate Steam copy.

This includes cracked or pirated builds, unauthorised ports, unauthorised mobile
or console versions, and any distribution channel not authorised by the publisher.
"Legitimate Steam copy" means a copy of Muse Dash obtained from Valve's Steam
store and run through Steam.

If you want to support another platform, ASK ME. Yes means yes; no means no.
Contact details are on the project page.

Otherwise you may use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense and
sell SkinForger, including commercially. The only formality: when you distribute
SkinForger or a modified SkinForger, include this licence so the next person also
learns of the condition above. (Lifting a snippet needs not even that — layer 1.)

--- Layer 3: no warranty, no liability ---

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS
FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT.

THE AUTHOR IS NOT LIABLE FOR ANYTHING. Whatever happens because you used this code
or used SkinForger — a broken game, lost saves, an affected account, corrupted
data, financial loss, or any other direct or indirect damage — IS YOUR OWN
RESPONSIBILITY. Problems in your modified version are especially your own. By
using this software you accept that.

--- Layer 4: what this licence does not cover ---

Skins made by players (PNG, JSON, audio) belong to their authors, are not part of
this project, and are not covered here. Ask that author before redistributing
their skin. The game's own assets are not part of this project either.

Upstream: SkinForger began as a modified MuseDashSkinChanger (BustR75 and
contributors, GPL-3.0). That code was rewritten and removed from 2026-11-17
onwards and is no longer present (evidence in `NOTICE.md`). It is still thanks to
their open code that this project could start at all — thank you.
